### DC Absoluto BR - API Tests
### Base URL
@baseUrl = http://localhost:3001
@characterSlug = batman
@universe = absolute

### ===================
### Health Check
### ===================

### Verificar status da API
GET {{baseUrl}}/health

### ===================
### Auth (Conta)
### ===================

### Registrar usuário
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Bruce Wayne",
  "email": "bruce@wayne.com",
  "password": "Senha123"
}

### Login (devolve "token": as rotas autenticadas usam o resultado desta requisição)
# @name login
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "bruce@wayne.com",
  "password": "Senha123"
}

### Confirmar e-mail
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/verify-email
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "token": "token-de-confirmacao"
}

### Reenviar confirmação de e-mail
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/resend-verification
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "bruce@wayne.com"
}

### Solicitar redefinição de senha
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/request-password-reset
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "bruce@wayne.com"
}

### Redefinir senha
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/reset-password
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "token": "token-de-redefinicao",
  "password": "NovaSenha456"
}

### Alterar senha (requer login)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/change-password
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.$.token}}

{
  "currentPassword": "Senha123",
  "newPassword": "NovaSenha123"
}

### Atualizar nome do perfil (requer login)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/profile-name
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.$.token}}

{
  "name": "Clark Kent"
}

### Atualizar foto de perfil (requer login)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/profile-image
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.$.token}}

{
  "profileImage": "batman"
}

### ===================
### Admin
### ===================

### Login de admin (só ADMIN_EMAIL; token vale 30 min e é usado no cadastro de HQs)
# @name adminLogin
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "leopetrecca@gmail.com",
  "password": "SUA_SENHA"
}

### ===================
### Comics (HQs)
### ===================

### Cadastrar HQ com universo default (omitir universe => absolute)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/comics
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{adminLogin.response.body.$.token}}

{
  "title": "Lanterna Verde Absoluta #12",
  "publisher": "DC Comics",
  "issueNumber": 12,
  "releaseDate": "2026-03-11",
  "downloadUrl": "https://www.mediafire.com/file/6ezfupbnhrs3l9d/LntrnVrd_Bslt_%252312_%25282026%2529_%2528DarkseidClub%2529.cbr/file",
  "coverUrl": "https://static.dc.com/2026-03/T2356500125001.jpg?w=640",
  "writer": "Al Ewing",
  "artists": "Jahnoy Lindsay",
  "characterId": "90df6742-054a-4af4-a32d-748a54b095d9"
}

### Cadastrar HQ em outro universo
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/comics
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{adminLogin.response.body.$.token}}

{
  "title": "Arqueiro Verde Absoluto #1",
  "universe": "absolute",
  "publisher": "DC Comics",
  "issueNumber": 1,
  "releaseDate": "2026-05-20",
  "downloadUrl": "https://www.mediafire.com/file/lef8zhov19ehd34/RqurVrd+Bslt+#01+(2026)+(DarkseidClub)",
  "coverUrl": "https://static.dc.com/2026-05/T2484700015001.jpg?w=640",
  "writer": "Pornsak Pichetshote",
  "artists": "Rafael Albuquerque, Marcelo Maiolo",
  "characterId": "8552b2fd-cafc-4d6e-bf52-e91b37d74f25"
}

### Buscar HQ por ID
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/comics/123e4567-e89b-12d3-a456-426614174000

### Buscar último lançamento do universo escolhido
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/comics/latest?universe={{universe}}

### Buscar contagem de HQs lidas do universo escolhido (requer login)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/comics/read/count?universe={{universe}}
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.$.token}}

### Buscar personagens mais lidos (requer login)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/comics/read/top-characters
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.$.token}}

### ===================
### Users (Usuários)
### ===================

### Buscar perfil público de um usuário
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/users/123e4567-e89b-12d3-a456-426614174000/profile

### ===================
### Characters (Personagens)
### ===================

### Listar todos os personagens
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/characters

### Buscar HQs de um personagem específico (por slug)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/characters/{{characterSlug}}/comics

### ===================
### Universes Flow
### ===================

### Buscar universos disponíveis de um personagem
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/characters/{{characterSlug}}/universes

### Buscar HQs de um personagem filtrando por universo
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/characters/{{characterSlug}}/comics?universe={{universe}}

### Buscar HQs de um personagem em outro universo
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/characters/{{characterSlug}}/comics?universe=earth-one

### ===================
### Newsletter
### ===================

### Inscrever email na newsletter
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/newsletter/subscribe
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "teste@exemplo.com"
}

### Inscrever email na newsletter de um personagem
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/newsletter/character/subscribe
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "teste@exemplo.com",
  "characterId": "123e4567-e89b-12d3-a456-426614174000"
}

### Desinscrever da newsletter geral
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/newsletter/unsubscribe/123e4567-e89b-12d3-a456-426614174000

### Desinscrever da newsletter de personagem
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/newsletter/character/unsubscribe/123e4567-e89b-12d3-a456-426614174000

### ===================
### Proxy (Download de arquivos)
### ===================

### Download de arquivo via proxy (evita CORS)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/proxy/download?url=https://example.com/file.cbr

### ===================
### Reportes
### ===================

### Enviar reporte/feedback
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/report/send
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "message": "O link de download do Absolute Batman #1 está quebrado."
}

### ===================
### Swagger (Documentação)
### ===================

### Abrir documentação Swagger
# Acesse: http://localhost:3001/swagger
